  "description": "A Traders hauler for carrying goods between markets, made by the ship generator (seed 7): a crew cab under a glass nose, a walkable spine with 8 standard containers in cradles off its flanks, an engineering block aft and two drive nacelles on pylons. Bunks, a head, a trade office, a galley, an airlock over the boarding shaft and the stores in the cab; the plant, the panel and the lockers in engineering. Its slots carry the reference fit: two couches, a drive on each nacelle's engine socket, the plant on the reactor socket, a sensor on the roof.",
